{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34713","headline":"夏日闲居作四声诗寄袭美 平去声 · 陆龟蒙","name":"夏日闲居作四声诗寄袭美 平去声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新开窗犹偏，自种蕙未徧。\n书签风摇闻，钓榭雾破见。\n耕耘闲之资，啸咏性最便。\n希夷全天真，讵要问贵贱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34713.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34713","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}